<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { title }) %></head>
<body>
<div class="layout">
  <%- include('partials/sidebar', { active: 'relatorios' }) %>
  <div class="main">
    <div class="page-content">

      <div class="content-head" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:4px;">Relatórios</h2>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;">Exportações e análises consolidadas dos dados cadastrados.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cards de relatório -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px;">

        <div class="section-card" style="padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
          <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7ed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;">📋</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:6px;">Cadastros por Bairro</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.5;">Total de famílias cadastradas agrupadas por bairro e nível de risco.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="export-actions" data-report-actions="bairro">
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="excel">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            Excel
          </button>
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="pdf">PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-card" style="padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
          <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#fef3e7;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;">⚠️</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:6px;">Famílias em Risco</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.5;">Lista de famílias com nível de risco ALTO ou MUITO_ALTO para priorização de visitas.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="export-actions" data-report-actions="risco">
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="excel">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            Excel
          </button>
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="pdf">PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-card" style="padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
          <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#e5fced;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;">✅</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:6px;">Completude de Cadastros</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.5;">Relatório de campos preenchidos vs. faltantes por família, com taxa de completude.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="export-actions" data-report-actions="completude">
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="excel">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            Excel
          </button>
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="pdf">PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-card" style="padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
          <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#eff6ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;">📊</div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:6px;">Vulnerabilidades</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.5;">Indicadores de vulnerabilidade (idosos, gestantes, PCD) consolidados por setor.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="export-actions" data-report-actions="vulnerabilidades">
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="excel">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
            Excel
          </button>
          <button class="btn btn--export" data-export-format="pdf">PDF</button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/js/api.js"></script>
<script src="/js/relatorios.js?v=20260626-2"></script>
</body>
</html>
